{"id":"valor","lemma":"valor","pos":"noun","rank":858,"glosses":["value (all senses)","security","worth"],"ipa":"/baˈloɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"valores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-valor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es de poco valor.","en":"It is of little value.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78227","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"little, not much"},null]},{"text":"Parece no tener ningún valor.","en":"It seems worthless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/119083","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have"},null,null]},{"text":"Esos son valores que compartimos todos.","en":"Those are values that we all share.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to share","l":"compartir"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"}]},{"text":"Fue un acto de valor.","en":"It was an act of courage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515925","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"act"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tuvo el valor de decirlo.","en":"She had the courage to say it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642178","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"}]}]}